{"contexts":[{"attribute":"industrialisation","confidence":"medium","description":"Аграрный приграничный округ Франкфурт стал промышленным благодаря металлургии и химии: доля занятых в промышленности выросла с 17% в 1955 году до 30% в 1989-м, а в сельском хозяйстве упала с 37% до 16%. В 1989 году округ давал пятую часть металлургической продукции ГДР. Население округа росло, тогда как в округах Лейпциг, Галле и Магдебург сокращалось.","from":1955,"id":"de-ctx-bezirk-frankfurt-1955-1989-industrialisation","locationId":"de-bezirk-frankfurt-oder","sourceIds":["de_stjb_ddr"],"statistics":[{"area_id":"de-bezirk-frankfurt-oder","indicator":"industry_share_of_employed","population":"занятые без учеников","source_id":"de_stjb_ddr","unit":"% of employed","value":17.2,"year":1955},{"area_id":"de-bezirk-frankfurt-oder","indicator":"industry_share_of_employed","population":"занятые без учеников","source_id":"de_stjb_ddr","unit":"% of employed","value":24.4,"year":1970},{"area_id":"de-bezirk-frankfurt-oder","indicator":"industry_share_of_employed","population":"занятые без учеников","source_id":"de_stjb_ddr","unit":"% of employed","value":29.6,"year":1989},{"area_id":"de-bezirk-frankfurt-oder","indicator":"agriculture_forestry_share_of_employed","population":"занятые без учеников","source_id":"de_stjb_ddr","unit":"% of employed","value":36.9,"year":1955},{"area_id":"de-bezirk-frankfurt-oder","indicator":"agriculture_forestry_share_of_employed","population":"занятые без учеников","source_id":"de_stjb_ddr","unit":"% of employed","value":15.8,"year":1989},{"area_id":"de-bezirk-frankfurt-oder","indicator":"district_share_of_gdr_metallurgy_output","population":"металлургия ГДР","source_id":"de_stjb_ddr","unit":"% of GDR output","value":20.5,"year":1989},{"area_id":"de-bezirk-frankfurt-oder","indicator":"population_thousand","population":"постоянное население округа","source_id":"de_stjb_ddr","unit":"thousand persons","value":666.3,"year":1955},{"area_id":"de-bezirk-frankfurt-oder","i